Subject: [PATCH] patch98 (GitHub #245): DualSense adaptive triggers - InputSystem::SetTriggerEffect (--pad_adaptive_triggers, off by default)

SDL_SendGamepadEffect with the DS5 effects body (enable bits 0x04/0x08, right effect at 10, left at 21) to PS5 pads
of one player; remembered per player (repeats write nothing, reconnected pads get it back), off while COGBox UI blocks
input, reset when the window closes. No InputDriver vtable change (non-virtual call on the runtime's own SDL driver).
New exports: InputSystem::SetTriggerEffect, InputSystem::AdaptiveTriggersEnabled - ship the runtime with the exe.

